        {
          "_type": "AsyncFunctionDef",
          "_fields": {
            "name": "_execute_retrieval",
            "args": {
              "_type": "arguments",
              "_fields": {
                "posonlyargs": [],
                "args": [
                  {
                    "_type": "arg",
                    "_fields": {
                      "arg": "plans",
                      "annotation": {
                        "_type": "Name",
                        "_fields": {
                          "id": "WorkflowPlanBundle",
                          "ctx": {
                            "_type": "Load",
                            "_fields": {}
                          }
                        },
                        "_lineno": 228,
                        "_col_offset": 11
                      },
                      "type_comment": "None"
                    },
                    "_lineno": 228,
                    "_col_offset": 4
                  },
                  {
                    "_type": "arg",
                    "_fields": {
                      "arg": "ctx",
                      "annotation": {
                        "_type": "Name",
                        "_fields": {
                          "id": "ExecutionContext",
                          "ctx": {
                            "_type": "Load",
                            "_fields": {}
                          }
                        },
                        "_lineno": 229,
                        "_col_offset": 9
                      },
                      "type_comment": "None"
                    },
                    "_lineno": 229,
                    "_col_offset": 4
                  }
                ],
                "vararg": "None",
                "kwonlyargs": [],
                "kw_defaults": [],
                "kwarg": "None",
                "defaults": []
              }
            },
            "body": [
              {
                "_type": "Expr",
                "_fields": {
                  "value": {
                    "_type": "Constant",
                    "_fields": {
                      "value": "\n    Phase-3 RAG execution.\n\n    This wires L2 into the deterministic retrieval pipeline:\n\n        1. Build a base query from job + resume (no external I/O).\n        2. Optionally generate a HYDE query via HYDEQueryAgent.\n        3. Call retrieval.run_rag_retrieval() to:\n              \u2013 perform BM25 / dense / hybrid retrieval\n              \u2013 fuse via weighted RRF\n              \u2013 apply QA-council evidence weighting (if council available)\n        4. Wrap the Evidence list in a typed RAGResult.\n    ",
                      "kind": "None"
                    },
                    "_lineno": 231,
                    "_col_offset": 4
                  }
                },
                "_lineno": 231,
                "_col_offset": 4
              },
              {
                "_type": "Assign",
                "_fields": {
                  "targets": [
                    {
                      "_type": "Name",
